# Java Microservices (POC sample bank)

- Spring Boot 3.x, Java 17
- Each granular service must have: `pom.xml`, `application.yml`, `openapi.yaml`
- Intentional smells (shared DB, sync chains) must **not** be refactored away
- EuroSA Bank branding; ZAR/FICA references for SA footprint
